Fixed the header bar and accessibility control stories rendering out of context. The accessibility controls are drawn as light pills for the dark header bar, so on the story's hardcoded pale background they read as unstyled browser buttons and wrapped onto two lines; they now render inside the same `header-wrapper` → `header-bar-wrapper` → `header-bar` → `header-bar__inner` chain the header builds. The hardcoded greys in the header bar, accessibility and dropdown stories were replaced with theme tokens so they follow the colour mode, and two Portuguese labels left in the header bar mocks were translated. @ericof
